{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":173688,"duration_api_ms":244727,"num_turns":15,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6f05ab70-947b-4276-89f3-ba01a9f92e43","total_cost_usd":0.9423954999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":53681,"cache_read_input_tokens":464789,"output_tokens":3573,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":53681,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":184,"outputTokens":14155,"cacheReadInputTokens":1032370,"cacheCreationInputTokens":88731,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.28510975,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":12,"outputTokens":3573,"cacheReadInputTokens":464789,"cacheCreationInputTokens":53681,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.65728575,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["All 6 tests (5 probes + summary runner) pass: `test result: ok. 6 passed; 0 failed` with shrimp probe suite outputting structured metrics for each scenario.","All 23 tracing tests pass including `trace_verbosity_reports_tick_snapshot_for_shrimp_probe_debugging` which validates per-tick shrimp state and water chemistry emission.","Clippy reports zero warnings on the workspace.","Two pre-existing test failures in `tank_data::presets` are caused by unstaged changes to `default.toml` from a different project (tanksim-6e5.7.2 param_meta annotations) — they pass on clean state and are unrelated to this deliverable.","AC1 (5 named tests with doc comments): Confirmed — `probe_successful_breeding`, `probe_thermal_suppression`, `probe_chemistry_stress`, `probe_chloride_protection`, `probe_crash_mode` each have multi-line doc comments explaining the husbandry story.","AC2 (failure dumps per-stage shrimp state and water chemistry per tick): Confirmed — `emit_tick_snapshot` emits per-tick counts/condition/reserve for adult/sub_adult/juvenile stages plus GH/pH/NO2/Cl/DO/temp, gated at Verbosity::Trace. The `shrimp_diag()` helper formats all life-stage counts, condition, reserve, molt_stress, molt_readiness, failed_molt_accum, and water chemistry into failure messages.","AC3 (e2e script with summary report, structured traces, non-zero exit on envelope violation): Confirmed — `all_shrimp_probes_summary` runs all 5 probes with catch_unwind, prints structured report with PASS/FAIL per probe, observed metrics, and failure details, then panics (non-zero exit) on any failure.","AC4 (directional/envelope assertions, no frozen exact counts): Confirmed — all probes use `>`, `<`, `>=` comparisons and Envelope ranges (pH 6.8-8.6, temp 23-26.5, etc.) rather than exact value assertions.","AC5 (breeding scenario 1000+ hours with 2+ reproductive cycles): Confirmed — breeding probe runs 60 days × 24h = 1440 hours, asserts `berried_cycle_count >= 2` out of 6 ten-day windows. Test output shows 6/6 cycles with population 10→260.","Chemistry stress molt failure assertion restored per amendment fr-1-4ed757e6: lines 771-779 check `molt_failures == 0 && failed_molt_accum <= 0.0` and record failure if neither signal is present. Fixture seeds adults at end of intermolt cycle (lines 682-687) to ensure molt resolution occurs within the 21-day window. Test output confirms `molt_failures=1, failed_molt_accum=0.300`.","Chloride protection uses real branched runs: pre-treatment crisis (3 days), then state is cloned into treated (NaCl 200 mg/L Cl) and control branches with 50% water changes, recovery assessed after 3 more days. Test output confirms `treated_deaths=0 < control_deaths=3` and `treated_hazard=0.3518 < control_hazard=4.3736`."],"findings_or_gaps":["The 2 pre-existing `tank_data::presets` test failures (from unstaged tanksim-6e5.7.2 param_meta changes in default.toml) are outside the scope of this deliverable but should be addressed in their own project to keep the full suite green.","The chemistry-stress probe now depends on seeded adult molt timing (`base_molt_interval_days`) to surface molt failures within 21 days — major future retunes of the molt interval could require fixture adjustment, as noted in the apply_fixes outstanding risks. This is an acceptable coupling given the scenario's purpose.","The thermal suppression probe's cool-tank shows unexpectedly high molt_stress=1.000 and failed_molt_accum=1.000, which seems high for what is meant to be the 'healthy control' at 25°C. The probe still passes because the directional comparison (warm reproductive_readiness < cool) holds, but the cool tank's condition (0.267) suggests it is also stressed, possibly from nitrite accumulation (NO2=1.7078). This doesn't violate any acceptance criterion but may warrant investigation during calibration work."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"f89ee9eb-71a0-4476-a3a8-e14086bf17e7"}
